{"id": "EUVD-2026-97369", "enisaUuid": "bcc1fbbc-a25c-3d68-bfad-3ca606cbbd10", "description": "ImageMagick before 6.9.13-58 and 7.x before 7.1.2-33 does not properly account for symbolic links in the IsRightsAuthorizedByName security policy check, allowing configured policy restrictions to be bypassed. Local attackers who can create a symlink can point it at a policy-restricted path to evade the configured policy.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:10:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T18:35:47", "baseScore": 2.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-79p5-w6jv-r997", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/imagemagick-before-7.1.2-33-policy-bypass-via-symlink-in-isrightsauthorizedbyname"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105081", "GHSA-gx8j-c5hq-h6p7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1d90e175-fd70-356e-96aa-c02a0a8f47aa", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.9.13-58"}, {"id": "9fbbd00d-fbe6-3152-b6df-0f1cec1bcf91", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "0 <7.1.2-33"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "126ab42f-7963-3453-898c-1689b207c8ed", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}], "isExploited": false}